    A  u_s = 1, s' = 2            23 rows  (Appendix-II shape; children K' = d_{s-1}/d_s)
    B  u_s = 1, s' >= 3           22 rows  (the depth residue Moh's method never treats)
    C  u_s >= 2 (prefix, D2)      20 rows  (19 at s'=2, 1 at s'=3; radius unlicensed)
