+| Row | first support | transported zero minor | finite-line packet |
+|---|---|---|---|
+| R049 | endpoint 2 | 1×4@6 | none |
+| R049 | 1 | 1×2@7 | 1×2@7 |
+| R054 | endpoint 2 | 1×4@4 | none |
+| R054 | 1 | 1×2@5 | 1×2@5 |
+| R065 | endpoint 4 | 1×8@33/4 | none |
+| R065 | 1 | 1×2@15 | 1×6@9 |
+| R065 | 2 | 2×2@21/2 | 1×4@9 |
