+
+For nineteen rows `s=3`. Set `e=delta_2=a/b`,
+`P=V_3 d_2/d_3`, `Q=V_3(n-M_2)/d_3`, `h=P/Q=d_2/(n-M_2)`.
+Enumerate exactly
+
+```text
+p_2 = pi^z product_j (pi^b-c_j)^r_j,
